New User Registration
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Before you finish, one thing that cannot be undone:

If you forget your passphrase, your private messages become permanently
unreadable. Not by the sysop, not by anyone. There is no reset, and inventing
one would defeat the point.

The sysop can reset your password, but doing so destroys your existing mail —
they will be warned, and so are you.

  [Y] I understand, create my account    [N] cancel

esc to disconnect